{
    "comment": "Finance documents with line items (stage 04.2: Quote, SalesOrder; 04.3: Invoice; 04.5: Act) and payments with their allocations (04.4). number: prefix + counter without padding; firstNumber = vtiger_modentity_num.cur_id at the audit snapshot (finance-contract.md §6), seeded by itvolga-setup-finance and raised, never lowered, at switchover. Every document carries the common Document fields of finance-contract.md §11, including the control totals (expected*, source*). payments.targets: document entity type => link of the allocation to it; those documents store their settlement (paidAmount, balanceAmount, settlementState); acts are not allocated to (no source payment points to an act). conversions.{from}.{to}: link of the new document to its source and the header fields copied; a link that is has-many on the new document keeps its key on the source (Invoice → Act: invoice.actId), and a source already linked to a live target gets no new one (ConversionSourceGuard). printForms.{entityType} (stage 05): the print form of a record — template: the body Resources/printForms/<template>.html; style: its CSS <style>.css (default: the template name; common.css is always included); partials: a file <partials>.html of inline Handlebars partials put before the body; title: file name prefix; dateField: the printed document date (createdAt — its calendar date in the system time zone); extraDateField: the second date of the form; onlyWhen: attribute values required to print (the server refuses others); sourceTemplateId: the SalesPlatform template it reproduces (sp_templates.templateid).",
